<newsitem itemid="74199" id="root" date="1996-09-24" xml:lang="en">
<title>SINGAPORE: LC Devt full year net up 162 percent.</title>
<headline>LC Devt full year net up 162 percent.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>			 (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     3.13  vs  1.19</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		     2.00  vs  1.00</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)		    2.40  vs  1.10</p>
<p>    Turnover				22.63  vs 18.47</p>
<p>    Interest income			1.80  vs  2.38</p>
<p>    Profits from associates	    0.19  vs  0.12 (loss)</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			 4.65  vs  2.38</p>
<p>    Tax					1.52  vs  1.19</p>
<p>Dividend pay date: To be announced.</p>
<p>Note - Investment holding company L.C. Development Ltd said better revenue and profit reflected sales revenue from a development and sale of more golf memberships by an associate, among other factors. The company said it expected improved turnover in the current year due to the launch of a residential project.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
</text>
